<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>She is as beautiful as Tirzah</l><l>As lovely as Jerusalem.</l><l>Through her living in Christ’s ascension</l><l>Her dear heart is now His home.</l><l>She’s become the sanctuary of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Who is this woman I am seeing?</l><l>Shining forth as the moon and sun.</l><l>She is absolutely heavenly,</l><l>From the old creation free;</l><l>Overcoming all to live within the veil.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>An army terrible with banners</l><l>Christ’s lovers overcome to be.</l><l>Those attracted by His beauty,</l><l>Fully trusting in His power.</l><l>Her romance is now the dances of two camps.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The Shulamite, His duplication,</l><l>His counterpart has now become.</l><l>She’s the same in life and nature,</l><l>His expression to the full;</l><l>Consummated as the New Jerusalem.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
